    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-πνέω</span></b> , of winds, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow against,</i>
			
